;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Öster</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:89.3%; left:26.8%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Landskrona_BoIS\" title=\"Landskrona BoIS\">Landskrona</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:93.9%; left:27.7%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em; left:-6.5em;width:6em;text-align:right;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:4px;left:2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bunkeflo_IF\" title=\"Bunkeflo IF\">Bunkeflo</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;z-index:200;top:63.7%; left:41.1%;height:0;width:0;margin:0;padding:0;\">\n<div style=\"position:relative;top:-4px;left:-4px;width:8px;text-align:center;line-height:0;z-index:201\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Red_pog.svg/20px-Red_pog.svg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;line-height:110%;position:relative;top:-1.5em;left:0.5em;text-align:left;width:9em;z-index:202;\"><div style=\"padding:1px;background:none\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:5px;left:-2px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/J%C3%B6nk%C3%B6pings_S%C3%B6dra_IF\" title=\"Jönköpings Södra IF\">Jönköpings Södra</a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:90%\">Placering av deltagande lag, Superettan 2007.</div>\n</div>\n<p><b>Superettan 2007</b> spelades mellan den <a href=\"/wiki/15_april\" title=\"15 april\">15 april</a> och den <a href=\"/wiki/27_oktober\" title=\"27 oktober\">27 oktober</a> <a href=\"/wiki/2007\" title=\"2007\">2007</a>. De tre främst placerade gick direkt till <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2008\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2008\">Allsvenskan 2008</a>. Inget kvalspel tillämpades denna säsong, då Allsvenskan utökades från 14 till 16 lag inför 2008 års säsong. I stället gick <a href=\"/wiki/IFK_Norrk%C3%B6ping\" title=\"IFK Norrköping\">IFK Norrköping</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ljungskile_SK\" title=\"Ljungskile SK\">Ljungskile SK</a> och <a href=\"/wiki/GIF_Sundsvall\" title=\"GIF Sundsvall\">GIF Sundsvall</a> direkt upp.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tabeller\">Tabeller</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2007&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Tabeller\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2007&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Tabeller\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Poängtabell\"><span id=\"Po.C3.A4ngtabell\"></span>Poängtabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2007&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Poängtabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Superettan_2007&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Poängtabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable infobox\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#bbffbb;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Uppflyttad till <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2008\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2008\">Allsvenskan 2008</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#ddffdd;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalspel om <a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollsallsvenskan_2008\" title=\"Fotbollsallsvenskan 2008\">Allsvenskan 2008</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#f0c4c4\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Nedflyttad till <a href=\"/wiki/Division_1_i_fotboll_f%C3%B6r_herrar_2008\" title=\"Division 1 i fotboll för herrar 2008\">Division 1 2008</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Superettan_2007\" title=\"Mall:Poängtabell för Superettan 2007\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Superettan_2007&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Superettan_2007&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\";\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">redigera</s